      "content": "but it's not just a \"single dataset,\" it's my entire identity. i've spent my whole life working toward this. i can't just \"stop\" feeling like a failure. everyone expects so much from me, and now i'm just going to have to tell them i wasted five years of their time and my own. there's no way to fix this. it's just over. everything is just over.",
