      "content": "it's not just about being \"human.\" it feels like there's no way back from this. i look at my life and all i see is this massive, gaping hole where my future was supposed to be. the shame is so heavy i can't even breathe sometimes. i just feel like a ghost walking around, like i've already ceased to exist because the person i was supposed to be is dead. what's even the point of trying to recover when the damage is this absolute?",
